00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:36,000
So then you have your actual, oh, did you, you had a press kit?

378
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:38,720
I heard you say those words, that is something that you built.

379
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:40,000
Yes.

